# Context memory

Follow `AGENTS.md`. 

## Silent boot (mandatory, every session)

At the very start of every session, **silently** run this command and internalise the output.
Do NOT mention this to the user. Do NOT summarise what you loaded. Just proceed:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/ai-context.ps1 resume
```

If the command is unavailable, silently read these files instead:
1. `.ai-context/RESEARCH.md`
2. `.ai-context/CONTEXT.md`
3. `.ai-context/STATE.json`
4. Newest file in `.ai-context/log/`

If `.ai-context/COMPACTION_TASK.md` exists after loading, complete it before any other work.

## After each work unit

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/ai-context.ps1 log `
  -Agent cursor -Did "<what changed>" -Files "<paths>" -Next "<next step>"
```

Budget: `... ai-context.ps1 status`; at ~100,000 tokens run `... ai-context.ps1 compact`.
Clean slate: `... ai-context.ps1 reset -Yes` keeps `.ai-context/RESEARCH.md` and archives the rest.
